      "year": 2026,
      "abstract": "In this text, we will explore the notion of Transcendental freedom as understood by thinker Leonardo Polo. A radical freedom, as an act, that is superior to the possible free manifestations of our natural powers. This freedom does not develop apart from truth and goodness; rather, its activity involves both. Corresponding to the personal being, it embraces strict novelty and the possession of the future without deferring it for the persona. It finds its meaning only in God.",
